; AVP: Auth-Session-State
; Command: Abort-Session-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 5.2.2.2.2
; Section: 5.2.4
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"In order to indicate that the session state is to be maintained, the Diameter client and server shall not include the Auth-Session-State AVP, either in the request or in the response messages"
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: sta-str-5-2-2-2-3-no-auth-session-state
; AVP: Auth-Session-State
; Command: Session-Termination-Request
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 5.2.2.2.3
; Section: 5.2.4
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"In order to indicate that the session state is to be maintained, the Diameter client and server shall not include the Auth-Session-State AVP, either in the request or in the response messages"
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: sta-sta-5-2-2-2-4-no-auth-session-state
; AVP: Auth-Session-State
; Command: Session-Termination-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 5.2.2.2.4
; Section: 5.2.4
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"In order to indicate that the session state is to be maintained, the Diameter client and server shall not include the Auth-Session-State AVP, either in the request or in the response messages"
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: sta-rar-5-2-2-3-1-no-auth-session-state
; AVP: Auth-Session-State
; Command: Re-Auth-Request
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 5.2.2.3.1
; Section: 5.2.4
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"In order to indicate that the session state is to be maintained, the Diameter client and server shall not include the Auth-Session-State AVP, either in the request or in the response messages"
    absent


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: sta-raa-5-2-2-3-2-no-auth-session-state
; AVP: Auth-Session-State
; Command: Re-Auth-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 5.2.2.3.2
; Section: 5.2.4
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"In order to indicate that the session state is to be maintained, the Diameter client and server shall not include the Auth-Session-State AVP, either in the request or in the response messages"
    absent


